  "raw_text": "their menu. Moving on, in what situations do you choose the Big Mac most often? Please consider factors like time... User: I choose the Big Mac whenever I get food from McDonald's whether it's lunch or dinner. It's Big Mac. Agent: Thank you. How does price change your choice? For example, if the Big Mac cost two... User: McDonald's recently went up on their prices. I stay with them because they're the best. But if McDonald's go up like two, three more dollars, I'm probably going to switch. Agent: I understand that a significant price increase might make you consider switching. What if there was a deal on the Big Mac or another McDonald's item? What would you do differently then? User: Whenever they have deals on Big Macs, I definitely buy the deal. But if they got a deal on another thing, I may not get it. But any deals on Big Macs, I'm there. Agent: Thank you for that insight. Over the past two weeks, what have been your most common fast-food patterns? This includes when you eat it,",
